# Strict ingest stores an enveloped entry that cannot be upcast to the target.
MODULE: StrictIngestDivertsOrphanAccepted
TARGET: StrictIngestDiverts
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: versioning accepts a newer or unreachable version on strict ingest
PERTURBS: RunVersioning

--- FIND
       ELSE IF origin = "Local" \/ ~tStrictV \/ val.tag \in Upcastable
--- REPLACE
       ELSE IF origin = "Local" \/ ~tStrictV \/ val.tag \in Tags
--- END
